WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,430
Okay master wow

2
00:00:05,430 --> 00:00:06,990
It feels much cooler all of a sudden

3
00:00:06,990 --> 00:00:08,030
I must work hard

4
00:00:08,030 --> 00:00:09,630
Stay in a hotel with grandma for the rest of your life

5
00:00:09,630 --> 00:00:11,350
Don't go upstairs after everyone has finished eating.

6
00:00:11,350 --> 00:00:12,590
Wait for me in the lobby for a while

7
00:00:12,590 --> 00:00:13,830
I have something to tell you

8
00:00:14,230 --> 00:00:18,040
Is Boss Xia going to save our money publicly?

9
00:00:18,040 --> 00:00:21,870
It’s not like I eat first and feel full even if I get kicked out.

10
00:00:21,870 --> 00:00:22,990
It’s not a loss if we’re full

11
00:00:23,630 --> 00:00:30,140
And those who eat noodles don’t have to refuse and just swallow them.

12
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:31,700
two customers

13
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:33,820
The restaurant will still be open tomorrow

14
00:00:33,820 --> 00:00:34,820
The boss is impatient with us

15
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:35,900
Eat him first

16
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:40,260
The high temperature record is coming

17
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:41,980
I have some fans and air conditioners here

18
00:00:41,980 --> 00:00:43,380
You can take it to your room and use it

19
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:45,500
Those who choose fans need to pay 30 cents per month

20
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:48,300
If you choose air conditioner, you need to pay more than 80 cents per month, which is great.

21
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:51,380
In this way, my mother can have a good sleep at night, okay?
